{"step_index":128,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-15T07:33:45Z","input_tokens":4643,"cache_read_tokens":72554,"output_tokens":901,"content":"### ✅ Backup Successfully Completed and Pushed to GitHub!\n\nYour entire personal workspace and pinned folders are now backed up and hosted at:\n👉 **[github.com/melwinabi/Ubuntu_Backup](https://github.com/melwinabi/Ubuntu_Backup)**\n\n---\n\n### 📦 What Was Backed Up (23,968 Files)\n\n| Folder | What Was Saved |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **`srm/`** | The full pinned SRM folder (architecture diagrams, flowcharts, schemas, and zip files). |\n| **`Documents/`** | All active codebases, embedded firmware, Arduino sketches, KiCad designs, PlatformIO projects, `Finance_Folio`, `Smart_Hub`, `Smart_Switch`, `PPV projects`, notes, and technical references. |\n| **`Downloads/`** | All project archives, resumes, offer letters, component datasheets, and documents. |\n| **`Pictures/`** | All screenshots, images, and webcam captures. |\n| **`Music/` & `Videos/`** | Directory structure and video files under 80 MB. |\n| **`system_info/`** | Text files listing all your installed **APT packages**, **Snap packages**, and system specs so you know which programs to install on Windows. |\n\n*(Bulky temporary build caches like `node_modules/` and `.next/`, along with 100MB+ installer files like `kicad.exe` or `android-studio.tar.gz`, were excluded to meet GitHub limits and keep the repository clean).*\n\n---\n\n### 💻 How to Restore Everything on Windows\n\nOnce you install Windows:\n\n1. **Option 1 (Direct Download):**  \n   Open [github.com/melwinabi/Ubuntu_Backup](https://github.com/melwinabi/Ubuntu_Backup), click the green **Code** button, and select **Download ZIP**.\n2. **Option 2 (Git Clone):**  \n   Install [Git for Windows](https://git-scm.com/download/win), open Command Prompt or PowerShell, and run:\n   ```cmd\n   git clone https://github.com/melwinabi/Ubuntu_Backup.git\n   ```\n\nYou can now proceed with your Windows installation with peace of mind.","thinking":"All data is successfully backed up and verified. The backup includes the specified files and directories, and is available at the provided link.\n\n\n"}
